Author: Platform Team <platform@acme.dev>
Date:   Tue Mar 11 14:22:07 2025 +0000

    replace per-request allocation with a pooled buffer

    The router allocated a fresh 64KiB scratch buffer for every request
    body it had to rewrite. Under load that dominated the allocator.

diff --git a/crates/router/src/body.rs b/crates/router/src/body.rs
index 4a3f9c1..e8b27d5 100644
--- a/crates/router/src/body.rs
